Create with revision 0; update with the revision returned by get. Unknown fields and raw credential values are rejected. Sources require a platform administrator; bindings require namespace ownership and source authorization.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime credential binding apply [flags]

Flags:
      --file string   Metadata JSON file or - for stdin (never secret values)
  -h, --help          help for apply

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
